    "group": "Champions of Fenris",
    "summary": "Your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY CHARACTER** units get this ability:\n\n**Countercharge**: For this unit, once per battle round, you can use the [Heroic Intervention](vsdata:ability/core.heroic-intervention) Stratagem on it, however often that Stratagem has already been used in the phase. That use does not stop the Stratagem being used on other units in the phase.\n\nYour army can contain **SPACE WOLVES** units, and no **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units of any other Chapter.",
